        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour destination is the prestigious Gamma Hospital in Hokkaido, where the global elite pay oppulent prices for the most prestigious care.\r\rYour targetsd are Chief Surgeon Nicholas Laurent, Chief Pathologist Katashi Ito and Hospital Director Akira Nakamura. These three men have recently brokered a deal with the Yakuza, allowing them to recieve the best protection money can buy, in exchange for free healthcare. Our client, a chief investor in Gamma, wants this deal stopped.",
